description:
REC-02/Q3 (user, 2026-11-01): krucyfiks gained Latest<T> { id, value } and LatestCommandSlot::accept. The change 'Adapt to krucyfiks Latest<T>' only rewrote the .map closures, so these outcome variants still copy the id into their own fields and check slot.accepts(id) separately:
- crates/kreatyna/src/ingredients/form.rs: IngredientFormOutcome::ConfirmationDecided { id, decision }, SaveFinished { id, result }
- crates/kreatyna/src/ingredients/detail.rs: IngredientDetailOutcome::ConfirmationDecided { id, decision }, DeleteFinished { id, result }
- crates/kreatyna/src/ingredients/list.rs: IngredientListOutcome::LoadFinished { id, result }
- crates/kreatyna-ffi/src/app_shell.rs: AppShellOutcome::DatabaseStopped(CommandId) -> DatabaseStopped(Latest<()>)
Make each one hold Latest<T>, map with the variant constructor, and unwrap with slot.accept(..) in the handler. Follow .agents/skills/krucyfiks-tag-command-outcomes/SKILL.md. Update the tests that build these outcomes.
